219
00:17:33,663 --> 00:17:38,755
the needle-thread tension after the assembly and three guides. Two,

220
00:17:38,775 --> 00:17:44,325
the assembly range on cotton that keeps the lock point balanced and firm,

221
00:17:44,345 --> 00:17:47,911
checked with a screenshot from the virtual lab.

222
00:17:48,311 --> 00:17:50,730
Three, four plies of denim.

223
00:17:50,750 --> 00:17:55,788
Find the least assembly setting and the tightening peak,

224
00:17:55,808 --> 00:17:59,763
