231
00:18:27,002 --> 00:18:31,934
the needle thread wraps a guide through 120 degrees with mu of 0.2.

232
00:18:31,954 --> 00:18:37,182
By what factor is the tension multiplied? Watch the units of the angle.

233
00:18:37,582 --> 00:18:42,456
Or, if the lock point sits in the middle of the cloth,

234
00:18:42,476 --> 00:18:46,082
must the two tensions be the right size?

235
00:18:46,482 --> 00:18:51,702
