236
00:18:53,222 --> 00:18:54,962
Three things to remember.

237
00:18:55,362 --> 00:18:59,028
One: the assembly adds a fixed amount,

238
00:18:59,048 --> 00:19:06,690
the guides multiply by e to the mu theta, and the eye cuts it to about a third,

239
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:13,382
so the needle tension at the lock point is about 0.41 of the setting.

240
00:19:13,782 --> 00:19:19,264
Two: the ratio of the two tensions decides where the threads lock;

241
00:19:19,284 --> 00:19:24,766
set the bobbin first, then the needle thread, and when diagnosing,

242
00:19:24,786 --> 00:19:27,100
find out which side changed.

243
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:30,797
Three: balance only means the ratio is right;

244
00:19:30,817 --> 00:19:35,440
the size of the tension decides tightness, pucker and breakage.

245
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:41,242
Next time: motion coordination and machine dynamics.

246
00:19:41,642 --> 00:19:45,855
