the assignment and the quiz are all on the WenQuest learning platform,

248
00:19:52,316 --> 00:19:58,462
at learn.wenquestrobotics.com. Sign up for free and start learning.

249
00:19:58,862 --> 00:20:02,524
Next time, we put the needle, take-up,

250
00:20:02,544 --> 00:20:09,985
hook and feed mechanisms back on one main shaft, see how they're coordinated,

251
00:20:10,005 --> 00:20:14,539
and why the whole machine shakes. See you then.
